comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-11T14:43:44.220Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete all-status searches for claim start receipt (70 hits) and start compact (112 hits), refreshed open and in_progress inventories, and full metadata of pm-eqdo85 and pm-eq4x. Plain claim compact receipts and lifecycle aliases are shipped; compound envelopes were intentionally preserved for compatibility. This is a distinct presentation enhancement, not a reopened historical defect. Measured in a disposable tracker with telemetry disabled; no repository items were used as test fixtures."
